ql shl q 5
qr shr q 27
qo or ql qr
q2 xor qo x
r rec s2 q2
ret r
end
# the CSE slot of a node: op (flags p5), its p4 final operands from p3, callee p6, pred p7
fn ozhash u32x128x100 u32x128x512 u32 u32 u32 u32 u32 u32 -> u32
