# Optimize functions [p12, p13) of a chunk's checked tables (as `wachunk` takes them: types
# p1, tlist p2, fns p3, nodes p4, operands p5 (p15 of them), ntys p6, pool p7, fnm p8, call
# table p9, iteration bounds p10, p11 types, p14 variants before) with the eval program p16
# p17 p18 and its map p19, then emit the chunk (p20 false) or write the optimized IR (p20).
