w2 fold ozdump gdm w1 n2 a2 y2 f2 p12 p13
w3 fold ozrq grq w2 o1 p13
r rec w3 code
ret r
end
fn ozemitst (io,u32) u32 u32x384x65 u32x128x65 u32x128x45 u32x128x128 u32x128x512 u32x128x24 u32x128x400 u32x128x16 u32x128x16 u32x128x8 u32 u32 u32 u32 u32 u32x128x45 u32x128x128 u32x128x512 u32x128x16 -> (io,u32)
t at p0 0
